  "scope": "A 32-node owned F32 graph with mutable code and live weights; an authored exact structural guard dispatches to a staged branch or the generic evaluator. Conservative helper extension and unconditional source-bound function equalities replay in core. All native/JS/Wasm observations, events, rollback and exact portable snapshots match the independent reference history. Complete loss/update/frame projections also admit independently. No measured performance or automatic profitable selection claim. Automatic guard insertion, broad learned representation search, device training and upstream performance parity remain open. Source translation, lowerers, runtime, ABI, toolchains and hardware remain trusted.",
